t }_{1/2}^{1}2x[{\\int }_{\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}^{0}{e}^{y}\\,\\text{d}y]\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1/2}^{1}2x\\cdot [{e}^{y}]_{y=\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}^{y=0}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1/2}^{1}2x(1-x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1/2}^{1}2x-2{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={[{x}^{2}-\\frac{2{x}^{3}}{3}]}_{x=1/2}^{x=1} \\\\  & =(1-\\frac{2}{3})-(\\frac{1}{4}-\\frac{1}{12}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535715 true] [17592186362930 1000 #edb/ref 17592186362931 13194139535715 true] [17592186362930 1000 #edb/ref 17592186362932 13194139535715 true] [17592186362930 1000 #edb/ref 17592186362933 13194139535715 true] [17592186362930 1000 #edb/ref 17592186362934 13194139535715 true] [17592186362930 1000 #edb/ref 17592186362935 13194139535715 true] [17592186362930 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535715 true] [17592186362930 1041 "selection" 13194139535715 true] [17592186362930 1104 #edb/ref 17592186362934 13194139535715 true] [17592186362930 1110 #uuid "88bfc1a7-3f48-56b5-88ba-63568ea12888" 13194139535715 true] [17592186362931 1034 "\\frac{5}{12}" 13194139535715 true] [17592186362931 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535715 true] [17592186362931 1111 #uuid "6fd94df3-8fa8-5a88-a171-bab7bad09cb1" 13194139535715 true] [17592186362932 1034 "\\frac{5}{6}" 13194139535715 true] [17592186362932 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535715 true] [17592186362932 1111 #uuid "f25aa412-5cb4-5941-a466-3265c8051cca" 13194139535715 true] [17592186362933 1034 "\\frac{2}{3}" 13194139535715 true] [17592186362933 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535715 true] [17592186362933 1111 #uuid "ea8e9aa4-3a86-58e5-806a-2e362fdd840d" 13194139535715 true] [17592186362934 1034 "\\frac{1}{6}" 13194139535715 true] [17592186362934 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535715 true] [17592186362934 1111 #uuid "76a431c9-2e15-56de-896d-da0bfbce2189" 13194139535715 true] [17592186362935 1034 "\\frac{1}{3}" 13194139535715 true] [17592186362935 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194