\\,\\,\\text{d}A,\\,{y}_{c}=\\frac{1}{{A}_{D}}{∬}_{D}y\\,\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the $x$-coordinate of the centroid is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{c} & =\\frac{1}{{A}_{D}}{∬}_{D}x\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{16}{\\int }_{0}^{4}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{y}}x\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{16}{\\int }_{0}^{4}{[\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}]}_{x=0}^{x=\\sqrt{y}}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{16}{\\int }_{0}^{4}\\frac{y}{2}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{16}{[\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}]}_{0}^{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{16}\\cdot 4 \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535715 true] [17592186362993 1000 #edb/ref 17592186362994 13194139535715 true] [17592186362993 1000 #edb/ref 17592186362995 13194139535715 true] [17592186362993 1000 #edb/ref 17592186362996 13194139535715 true] [17592186362993 1000 #edb/ref 17592186362997 13194139535715 true] [17592186362993 1000 #edb/ref 17592186362998 13194139535715 true] [17592186362993 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535715 true] [17592186362993 1041 "selection" 13194139535715 true] [17592186362993 1104 #edb/ref 17592186362996 13194139535715 true] [17592186362993 1110 #uuid "ee81b702-4f56-543d-ab2a-e611150faabd" 13194139535715 true] [17592186362994 1034 "\\frac{4}{3}" 13194139535715 true] [17592186362994 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535715 true] [17592186362994 1111 #uuid "1ade97b3-3ae1-52f0-a660-f45c4eed2137" 13194139535715 true] [17592186362995 1034 "1" 13194139535715 true] [17592186362995 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535715 true] [17592186362995 1111 #uuid "2306a1c0-5717-58af-af3e-31d99274ea46" 13194139535715 true] [17592186362996 1034 "\\frac{3}{4}" 13194139535715 true] [17592186362996 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535715 true] [17592186362996 1111 #uuid "9d349b4b-bbba-5f3b-9089-6ed2a4ec9289" 13194139535715 true] [17592186362997 1034 "\\frac{3}{2}" 13194139535715 true] [17592186362997 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535715 true] [17592186362997 1111 #uuid "8b074062-4e25-5d62-8d85-ee909