region:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14068268/assets/a8c57b12334a23542bae73ba1ac6848e69830b9663a1f83b6340f6812974f416.png)\n\nSo, we have \n\n$$\nD={(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le {y}^{2},\\,-2\\le y\\le 0}\n$$\n\nand ${A}_{D}=\\frac{8}{3}.$\n\nTherefore, the $y$-coordinate of the centroid is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}_{c} & =\\frac{1}{{A}_{D}}{∬}_{D}y\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{8}{\\int }_{-2}^{0}{\\int }_{0}^{{y}^{2}}y\\,\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{8}{\\int }_{-2}^{0}y\\,{\\int }_{0}^{{y}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{8}{\\int }_{-2}^{0}y[x]_{x=0}^{x={y}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{8}{\\int }_{-2}^{0}y({y}^{2}-0)\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{8}{\\int }_{-2}^{0}{y}^{3}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{8}{[\\frac{{y}^{4}}{4}]}_{-2}^{0} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{8}\\cdot (0-4) \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535715 true] [17592186363007 1000 #edb/ref 17592186363008 13194139535715 true] [17592186363007 1000 #edb/ref 17592186363009 13194139535715 true] [17592186363007 1000 #edb/ref 17592186363010 13194139535715 true] [17592186363007 1000 #edb/ref 17592186363011 13194139535715 true] [17592186363007 1000 #edb/ref 17592186363012 13194139535715 true] [17592186363007 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535715 true] [17592186363007 1041 "selection" 13194139535715 true] [17592186363007 1104 #edb/ref 17592186363010 13194139535715 true] [17592186363007 1110 #uuid "74b0e5b4-82ac-55ea-922e-a06b356ae442" 13194139535715 true] [17592186363008 1034 "-\\frac{8}{5}" 13194139535715 true] [17592186363008 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535715 true] [17592186363008 1111 #uuid "198dbaa0-6aae-5562-839e-c47b2c007959" 13194139535715 true] [17592186363009 1034 "-\\frac{6}{5}" 13194139535715 true] [17592186363009 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535715 true] [17592186363009 1111 #uuid "c3233fac-f41a-5e7c-9a70-cf7cdbebae7d" 13194139535715 true] [1759218